4a-c1d4-4e78-8881-539b6b8502d5" ulx="442" uly="1366" lrx="844" lry="1395" /><zone xml:id="m-ecb30745-a5f8-4fe8-a4e0-7d53a723981c" ulx="25" uly="1387" lrx="430" lry="1421" /><zone xml:id="m-1ff6a94a-de5a-480c-816e-65ffd766519b" ulx="442" uly="1390" lrx="841" lry="1422" /><zone xml:id="m-80d4ac5f-b5ef-4158-beb4-c05d6b556182" ulx="27" uly="1414" lrx="842" lry="1453" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-9718cecf-e74f-40a6-9e7d-5394d58c2c01" n="0875" facs="#m-4c4acebc-5025-41b7-b085-4d7e9903efa3" /><div xml:id="m-da5bfe05-f312-4270-ac17-15599963de44">
            <lg xml:id="m-fc3144e6-edc8-4266-825c-1509fd312a84">
              <l xml:id="m-f4c0c27a-27f1-44a0-89e7-c0abacf718f6" facs="#m-72465772-f114-4cfc-b3a8-fef0b92a9128" label="ambiguous">729</l><l xml:id="m-54db089a-5d14-4333-8e1d-6262f44171f8" facs="#m-5e326d7b-4437-4607-84fb-832ecf62fca9" label="text-like">The Solemn afternoon Liturgy</l><l xml:id="m-8c23616c-35da-450c-96c7-8e8271924f61" facs="#m-35670e3e-0e1a-44f0-837e-e38837a6031f" label="text-like">wearing his stole crossed on his breast. Accompanied by two servers, the</l><l xml:id="m-a5086c82-4283-4ebb-a1e4-a30007957e6b" facs="#m-4adb0680-2658-4724-969a-aac302b61716" label="text-like">deacons come to the foot of the altar with the celebrant between them. All</l><l xml:id="m-9015a04c-793d-4837-8dd5-1bb342775875" facs="#m-c55115f3-a819-4665-bae4-66e08d88d207" label="ambiguous">bou deeply saying silently:</l><l xml:id="m-1edfc479-414d-4c03-b9a9-6405b8b47c7c" facs="#m-1ed342a4-d9e3-4f70-b035-5b1c4bc82478" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus sit in corde meo et in lábiis meis. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-34fc9df5-f13d-4ef2-9a3f-59bfd9557919" facs="#m-29002423-e98c-4b37-8ba3-eaf718c2cf3d" label="text-like">They stand upright, bou to the altar and go to the Gospel side of the</l><l xml:id="m-d7cfbb69-60b4-4857-bf4d-d1a10f227944" facs="#m-11cad7ae-07ee-4434-8fbc-dc2826fc441c" label="text-like">sanctuary to sing or read the Passion. The celebrant stands on ihe Chronicler's</l><l xml:id="m-1489530c-0883-4411-83e6-f61dd31f7589" facs="#m-8de13ab3-1464-4600-81c8-5a666c5275aa" label="text-like">right, in the first place, nearest the altar.]</l><l xml:id="m-d8311ec8-0e8c-4289-be6f-e9d030f8cf65" facs="#m-039b8705-46dc-46c3-a86c-f7aa0d84da6e" label="ambiguous">Passio Domini nostri Jesu Christi secundum Joannem</l><l xml:id="m-05f76ea4-e57b-4ec5-9218-d86782712c24" facs="#m-fb38195c-f849-40aa-bc3e-b43912145393" label="ambiguous">18, 1-40; 19, 1-42</l><l xml:id="m-62c2e71a-447e-4af9-8d61-3aed0a6b29ab" facs="#m-7ce374cb-d84d-4b37-a98f-2e3a034569c0" label="lyrics-like">(N illo témpore: Egréssus est non bibam illum? C. Cohors</l><l xml:id="m-34275cee-d53b-4ea4-b5ca-8b9d9508c255" facs="#m-6cba2bed-4c59-4aee-8aa7-81ac610d7b90" label="lyrics-like">L Jesus cum discípulis suis trans lergo, et tribúnus, et ministri</l><l xml:id="m-cef9cc89-6cd8-4490-b6ea-80d4b13acaeb" facs="#m-2e57ead8-5d88-425b-9dfb-63921ddcbe0c" label="lyrics-like">Judacórum comprehendérunt Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-988720a1-d581-4d61-a15d-9b69bd251bab" facs="#m-1b788229-932f-4fcf-8113-b87da729f5f3" label="lyrics-like">torréntem Cedron, ubi erat hor¬</l><l xml:id="m-365fc931-b466-48a1-bfa3-6ec1b72a51e1" facs="#m-abb65e90-aa84-4a04-885d-f0e602a2cadc" label="lyrics-like">sum, et ligavérunt eum.</l><l xml:id="m-a69fca7f-a051-4550-8232-e26a39fefca7" facs="#m-3107b601-d7cd-4340-8164-cee96f34e6f0" label="ambiguous">tus, in quem introivit ipse, et</l><l xml:id="m-0728aacd-93f5-4d2e-b9ab-3a91315ee3f8" facs="#m-e652cc98-febe-474d-bea4-102e469c9f01" label="lyrics-like">discipuli ejus. Sciébat autem et</l><l xml:id="m-fff03ffe-7cb7-48cf-9597-7c631a23605b" facs="#m-277f0094-f0c9-4361-aa5b-24521b7ee749" label="lyrics-like">Et adduxérunt eum ad Annam</l><l xml:id="m-8b4fbfcb-329f-4369-a98b-c92dbdacd970" facs="#m-a768638d-5276-45e3-8f5d-57668937a54d" label="lyrics-like">Judas, qui tradébat eum, locum:</l><l xml:id="m-1864fd57-9f17-43bf-aa1d-8472fc83342b" facs="#m-7885e368-7986-4c30-a49a-cce1b9742a1e" label="lyrics-like">primum; erat enim socer Cái¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcc2b105-2a25-4606-9e18-02e83075ec31" facs="#m-3e25548c-48cb-4fda-bfa3-5ce32d3b407d" label="lyrics-like">phae, qui erat póntifex anni</l><l xml:id="m-c32749d6-ab24-4586-8c77-613d6b9cb0db" facs="#m-7563bdd6-8509-4356-a5a1-e352af121869" label="lyrics-like">quia frequénter Jesus convénerat</l><l xml:id="m-ec267490-413d-4a52-9c4c-9bfdb93eeb99" facs="#m-5333ff33-029f-4167-8dba-815565961e4a" label="ambiguous">illlus. Erat autem Caiphas, qui</l><l xml:id="m-d4b6f8c0-eeb7-4428-af2b-eff984f280e9" facs="#m-aa49d596-1c7b-4529-8644-2feb41ab6806" label="lyrics-like">illuc cum discípulis suis. Judas</l><l xml:id="m-8f31ef80-7b70-480f-b907-5c40041390ae" facs="#m-492b209d-61b3-44ec-95fa-e91782a2a8fd" label="lyrics-like">consilium déderat Judaéis: Quia</l><l xml:id="m-5fa81b68-54b9-4bbf-9fdb-e6f0e009cfc1" facs="#m-9704b11c-c252-4655-95f9-569d80bfa555" label="lyrics-like">ergo cum accepísset cohórtem,</l><l xml:id="m-91cd141f-2170-4649-a8b4-7f337a3154ee" facs="#m-59de4ff2-3d1c-4208-9963-cee1b769a4cc" label="lyrics-like">et a pontifícibus et pharisaéis</l><l xml:id="m-342dbd84-b933-45c3-8dd3-f3b3a14e35d5" facs="#m-27fe165e-85ed-4991-941d-22583823c809" label="lyrics-like">éxpedit unum hóminem mori</l><l xml:id="m-f79e12c1-3dcf-48ba-ab25-3a2cee55eed6" facs="#m-6a5041b7-db14-41cc-8498-0dbf2065d940" label="lyrics-like">minístros, venit illuc cum latér¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f88969c-eab2-48eb-a90a-a7950f17aa55" facs="#m-353e82ec-cad6-40ec-b020-58b2471a34b2" label="lyrics-like">pro pópulo. Sequebátur autem</l><l xml:id="m-f08f5da8-579a-43db-a24f-eb6c1a10701e" facs="#m-cd8cf72e-fa49-4348-a82f-8025f14f2e33" label="lyrics-like">Jesum Simon Petrus, et álius</l><l xml:id="m-39b8b1fc-0a31-4fa9-accd-a4acfc6dd7f8" facs="#m-1b6b3b32-5d93-4beb-96eb-2afd18db9122" label="lyrics-like">nis, et fácibus, et armis. Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-01550df0-9f91-4af2-9041-98a8aa588733" facs="#m-76b295c9-d6c8-42a1-8f72-65f66b2b63e9" label="lyrics-like">itaque sciens ómnia, quae ven¬</l><l xml:id="m-12be0874-42f2-489e-a0b9-2f8366d3429d" facs="#m-d353bbb7-967b-4c75-8a1d-54bbb1de37cf" label="lyrics-like">discipulus. Discípulus autem ille</l><l xml:id="m-766bb98e-29f9-4ef4-ab61-c3ceb508fd92" facs="#m-6c8825ad-d29f-4d18-88ac-6a0f79fe108f" label="lyrics-like">túra erant super eum, procéssit,</l><l xml:id="m-5c592aae-55f6-415b-a809-1da25389a924" facs="#m-c42a9563-cd73-4a30-b36d-7507530b21e6" label="ambiguous">erat notus pontifici, et introivit</l><l xml:id="m-b3bdc60b-80ca-4826-80c5-652f400bfd02" facs="#m-a93e8ed3-d660-4178-a3a0-2537ae7974ee" label="lyrics-like">et dixit eis:  Quem quaéritis?</l><l xml:id="m-bd7d5c12-f993-44c2-a7e3-1535e0059624" facs="#m-365eff99-7a1b-47f4-886d-dcc9f6371c69" label="lyrics-like">cum Iesu in átrium pontificis.</l><l xml:id="m-a91ddf3a-5a45-4ead-a607-95b903d065c7" facs="#m-99076c03-850e-408f-8774-e174385f5568" label="lyrics-like">C. Respondérunt ei: S Jesum</l><l xml:id="m-8c58077a-e8b8-41c9-ae65-f9a26056bed3" facs="#m-688ffb7f-12f0-4245-96e8-644e7d2d684d" label="lyrics-like">Petrus autem stabat ad óstium</l><l xml:id="m-22650691-9de6-4ec0-96ce-5fa26bb8c252" facs="#m-3826fe74-369a-4238-85b3-9c42ee975473" label="lyrics-like">Nazarénum. C. Dicit eis Jesus : 4</l><l xml:id="m-623c8db9-581b-4131-8746-8fe40cfa5eba" facs="#m-f6905934-1505-487c-9394-002740d9b2e1" label="lyrics-like">foris. Exivit ergo discipulus álius,</l><l xml:id="m-2c65a5fc-7185-432c-9911-fb9de9867095" facs="#m-59ff9ccf-d97a-4f84-8edc-1c8eb0af0c4c" label="ambiguous">qui erat notus pontifici, et dixit</l><l xml:id="m-5c6d6be0-0734-4c3d-85a0-88ea5ac7a7c5" facs="#m-38cc678b-3c59-4ff2-96da-7fc0afaa4e03" label="ambiguous">Ego sum. C. Stabat autem et</l><l xml:id="m-621dc425-65b6-40e5-90f7-3995419e1755" facs="#m-c1ef6096-4366-4d11-bc8e-510d16675e15" label="lyrics-like">ostiáriae: et introdúxit Petrum.</l><l xml:id="m-92fc41aa-939c-45cd-b28e-6e20e55621df" facs="#m-81cc244e-acd7-4133-b97e-7faa73e45f48" label="lyrics-like">Judas, qui tradébat eum, cum</l><l xml:id="m-566d3b1f-0652-4b7d-a1f5-fc4ac7937351" facs="#m-1644a636-02da-47aa-ba9c-455f0c3d993d" label="lyrics-like">Dicit ergo Petro ancilla ostiária:</l><l xml:id="m-aa0c7445-3fd7-4bed-be4d-a045232511ab" facs="#m-94484155-ae7b-4f19-8e4a-b131356fad7d" label="ambiguous">ipsis. Ut ergo dixit eis: Ego</l><l xml:id="m-c864b5cb-56bb-4e5a-9e98-808d5a3201c3" facs="#m-a4e70526-354e-4117-8214-0c156d808383" label="ambiguous">s. Numquid et tu ex discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-9c747292-bc77-4b16-876d-e77cb059fe89" facs="#m-5bff101e-4fae-4e51-ba59-e54ad5266d46" label="lyrics-like">sum: abiérunt retrórsum, et</l><l xml:id="m-01d0d89e-be86-45bf-b8cc-43ab60b919ee" facs="#m-f8725bba-82c3-49f4-98db-a52356d1688a" label="lyrics-like">es hóminis istius? C. Dicit ille:</l><l xml:id="m-52e693af-c502-43ec-8405-fcf6f5c097a2" facs="#m-54eb7898-1509-47df-a86c-75fcbd1e8ec4" label="lyrics-like">cecidérunt in terram. Iterum</l><l xml:id="m-94cf064f-9d92-4564-85a7-b6c4d6e27b17" facs="#m-d295ab4d-32a0-4d1d-a757-1d1baccfaef6" label="ambiguous">S. Non sum. C. Stabant autem</l><l xml:id="m-e727aee6-18bd-40a8-be05-7c315016c6e5" facs="#m-7aae5d0a-4ee2-4822-83d0-23f65b63304e" label="lyrics-like">ergo interrogávit eos: 4 Quem</l><l xml:id="m-c12b4730-6f26-41ed-8e2d-60f0bc1d636c" facs="#m-21c87e6b-024f-44f2-a37b-287b83b8d8bb" label="ambiguous">servi, et ministri ad prunas:</l><l xml:id="m-11708f45-b306-4108-b3fd-7415766097d4" facs="#m-b9210c93-f6fc-4d14-938e-dff74d28d135" label="lyrics-like">quaéritis? C. Illi autem dixé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f75c29dc-1601-4d50-8080-0dbf9cc2980e" facs="#m-7919df17-983c-40d9-ab68-457d0aa6ec45" label="lyrics-like">quia frigus erat, et calefaciébant</l><l xml:id="m-6b399a95-19b1-4fdf-a154-3622b33f5576" facs="#m-888ace7a-9c57-4712-9d12-932652182b59" label="lyrics-like">runt: S. Jesum Nazarénum.</l><l xml:id="m-2bbe5660-18b9-42f1-bd9e-27672c8946b7" facs="#m-45094f5e-ce64-4999-98b5-7c6772a3d768" label="lyrics-like">C. Respóndit Jesus: </l><l xml:id="m-2c590e31-aadc-4587-8df0-d7f4dd79c75b" facs="#m-d99d377f-f74b-4b69-a7db-c26a559dc232" label="ambiguous">se: erat autem cum eis et Petrus</l><l xml:id="m-27760095-b19f-42bd-8586-d3fde65fa7ea" facs="#m-9450a86c-ced9-4cec-be60-310b5c93529f" label="lyrics-like">stans, et calefáciens se.</l><l xml:id="m-f0ee1a4f-066f-4015-866c-26b742a071c6" facs="#m-033ac5dc-e830-4abc-a3ff-8254749954e9" label="ambiguous">vobis, quia ego sum: si ergo</l><l xml:id="m-3835e6b7-204e-4468-a03c-362d579b6abf" facs="#m-bc4cfa29-e62c-42a9-866c-fd936f4ec888" label="lyrics-like">Póntifex ergo interrogávit Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-55701eed-9cfe-43c1-8b38-4c7ffe8c5c6d" facs="#m-0632bc1e-64b4-46be-9421-dc826a1aac33" label="lyrics-like">me quaéritis, sinite hos abire.</l><l xml:id="m-a1296da8-986b-4a4c-8197-5a1dab772b54" facs="#m-4fed1cec-1760-4d5f-9e1f-47f0b1d38f15" label="ambiguous">sum de discipulis suis, et de do¬</l><l xml:id="m-33c5cd60-48c5-4ac4-890f-d60eeab7e587" facs="#m-d07ac320-c98c-41f0-b484-d3c971f9d0a1" label="lyrics-like">C. Ut implerétur sermo, quem</l><l xml:id="m-ac78e9e9-60b3-44e2-a8eb-0dba59a45dc7" facs="#m-5057021c-f75a-4009-9dad-cd24b804ac13" label="lyrics-like">dixit: Quia quos dedísti mihi,</l><l xml:id="m-647a38d0-0c17-4765-a311-545001f4dd48" facs="#m-78d45c44-c33a-4f56-a70d-c0d28c582e7f" label="lyrics-like">ctrina ejus. Respóndit ei Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-09f6027f-7773-45dc-af7c-7f6cbe777321" facs="#m-49317153-e031-4e9a-af58-d9f81dedb52b" label="lyrics-like">non pérdidi ex eis quemquam.</l><l xml:id="m-c017435f-14ba-4236-b0f0-27f0d760f713" facs="#m-adeae26c-9aba-47d8-bec4-19b30362855f" label="lyrics-like">—Ego palam locútus sum mun¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b17ecb8-30f0-4f91-9ef3-58090fb23f51" facs="#m-9d592b28-4d6e-46a2-a84d-8cfa463de981" label="lyrics-like">Simon ergo Petrus habens glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-14f1d2f5-4dec-484c-bd47-138be11b39d2" facs="#m-702607d3-277f-4ee6-8705-a7ccf5515866" label="lyrics-like">do: ego semper dócui in syna¬</l><l xml:id="m-90312195-e501-486d-a9ed-036e211b639f" facs="#m-f03e55d2-68a3-4593-9d94-4a3aae24c86c" label="lyrics-like">dium edúxit eum: et percússit</l><l xml:id="m-7147785b-e287-4e60-94ad-e3b4dd6a4400" facs="#m-f32f9423-4a50-4dcb-b5a4-66f15ad6b896" label="lyrics-like">góga, et in templo, quo omnes</l><l xml:id="m-595253df-aa4f-4b44-be36-597639c0f7ab" facs="#m-e01e1129-67c2-4ad8-8509-73083b43cb5b" label="lyrics-like">pontíficis servum : et abscídit</l><l xml:id="m-3875c83a-0fdc-46fb-9b01-3bdb2fae239a" facs="#m-67b43c4e-df57-47f0-ad49-c55f56195499" label="lyrics-like">Judaéi convéniunt : et in occulto</l><l xml:id="m-54aa25e9-8916-4995-9a88-32d0bf9a97c1" facs="#m-a5384d09-0a90-4ec8-9ed4-3038e4acd296" label="lyrics-like">locútus sum nihil. Quid me intér¬</l><l xml:id="m-f6ec9fb9-6bb4-4365-8196-7706027cb203" facs="#m-a63f53ce-1306-4d9d-bbc6-644f86888f92" label="lyrics-like">auriculam ejus déxteram. Erat</l><l xml:id="m-1686c0ad-81e7-49de-a23d-a2150aed18de" facs="#m-b4d22d5a-1175-4542-929b-6e624e6a7168" label="ambiguous">autem nomen servo Malchus.</l><l xml:id="m-8b490f37-7fae-4509-b479-4c7e7622a08e" facs="#m-e6ef69c0-0466-4a09-ad8f-3e39ea04e8d7" label="lyrics-like">rogas? intérroga eos, qui audié¬</l><l xml:id="m-329ca4c8-e05c-441d-99e9-9e4c00f8198a" facs="#m-c757a9e6-bdc7-4e66-8b0d-c1463a7c314a" label="ambiguous">pixit ergo Jesus Petro :t Mitte</l><l xml:id="m-44bf7e3b-faec-4c91-85db-d14bc2a7fe8a" facs="#m-ff7fc14a-c1d4-4e78-8881-539b6b8502d5" label="lyrics-like">runt quid locútus sim ipsis: ecce</l><l xml:id="m-0c6d5c47-a1a6-407b-9b37-663de5ff7ec5" facs="#m-ecb30745-a5f8-4fe8-a4e0-7d53a723981c" label="lyrics-like">gládium tuum in vagínam. Cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7243dba8-ff8b-453e-8a6d-09f6fada39bf" facs="#m-1ff6a94a-de5a-480c-816e-65ffd766519b" label="ambiguous">hi sciunt quae dixerim ego.</l><l xml:id="m-4429a686-82ff-496e-b6c5-a3d61c951b34" facs="#m-80d4ac5f-b5ef-4158-beb4-c05d6b556182" label="ambiguous">licem, quem dedit mihi Pater,l C.Haec autem cum dixisset, unus</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>